sequenceDiagram
    actor Player
    participant API as GraphicsAPI
    participant InputHandlerSystem
    participant EventBus
    participant PlayerSystem
    participant MovementSystem
    participant CollisionProcessor
    participant VelocityProcessor
    participant World

    Player->>API: Press WASD / move mouse
    API->>InputHandlerSystem: emit KeyInputEvent / MouseInputEvent
    InputHandlerSystem->>EventBus: publish input event
    EventBus-->>PlayerSystem: input event

    PlayerSystem->>EventBus: publish MovementProposalEvent(s)
    EventBus-->>MovementSystem: MovementProposalEvent
    MovementSystem->>CollisionProcessor: validateMove(...)
    MovementSystem->>VelocityProcessor: validateMove(...)

    alt move accepted
        MovementSystem->>World: update entity position
        MovementSystem->>EventBus: publish MovementEvent
    else move rejected
        MovementSystem->>EventBus: queue proposal again if retryOnRejection
    end
